  "details": "Hello,\n\nI've noticed that the VRChat Creator Companion shortcut in the Start Menu (inside %appdata%\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Start Menu\\Programs) will always have the name \"CreatorCompanion.lnk\", even if we rename it correctly to \"VRChat Creator Companion.lnk\".\n\nJust wait a little, or update the software, and it will revert to this incomplete name.\n\nWhat can I say, it can be a real hassle to find the VCC...\n\nThank you,\n\nLusiiky",
